  "content": "<h1>机械动力：物品与扩展 - 储罐修复</h1>\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-stuff-and-addition-tank-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.bypixel.dev/raw/4dlsHJ.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-and-addition-tank-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/F4MtFnv7/cozy-64h.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/serverside-swzo/Create-Stuff-and-Addition-Tank-Fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DPnZdBK5/41dfe80a399c0c8466f8cecc9f35048de5066e11-1.png\" alt=\"Github\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fnDhkgzAPR2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg&amp;h=64\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/serverside-swzo/Create-Stuff-and-Addition-Tank-Fix/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/serverside-swzo/Create-Stuff-and-Addition-Tank-Fix.svg\" alt=\"GitHub issues\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://ghloc.vercel.app/api/serverside-swzo/Create-Stuff-and-Addition-Tank-Fix/badge&amp;color=2ecc71\" alt=\"代码行数\"></p>\n\n<p>一个简单的模组，用于修复并添加与<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-stuff-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：物品与扩展</a>中储罐的集成功能，适用于 NeoForge 1.21.1 版本。</p>\n\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>喷射口填充：</strong> 通过注册 NeoForge 流体功能，修复机械动力：物品与扩展模组中的储罐，使其能够被机械动力的喷射口、管道及其他流体传输方块填充（每次 1000 毫桶）。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>熔炉燃料：</strong> 燃料储罐（熔岩）现在可作为可重复使用的燃料源。罐子不会被立即消耗，而是保留在燃料槽中并逐步消耗其内部容量。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>沉浸式飞机集成：</strong> 为你的飞机和陀螺仪加油！将储罐放入飞机的锅炉/燃料槽即可。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>精巧核心集成（可选）：</strong> 提供对<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精巧核心</a>储罐升级的完整支持。此功能在安装精巧核心后自动启用，允许在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精巧存储</a>容器和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精巧背包</a>内快速填充和排空机械动力：物品与扩展模组中的储罐。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Curios 储罐槽：</strong> 添加一个自定义的 \"储罐\" Curios 槽位，使机械动力：物品与扩展模组中的储罐可以作为饰品佩戴（如果安装了 Curios 模组）。</p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>展示</h2>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db633e7972a9ee684a4bb85ab3abe9c3b657ec81.png\" alt=\"展示图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/68e434c350da39566bac1255318a3120e5391039.png\" alt=\"储罐升级展示\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dac02291458d81ede84aa927ecbada63f5a1d5ac.png\" alt=\"Curios 槽位\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4e167c50826fa8b727158894f533d49ec1035ca4.png\" alt=\"沉浸式飞机兼容\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d6ffaf453d99f1e5cb1ef6b38c67d8b4c4370727.png\" alt=\"熔炉兼容\"></p>",
